#, python-format
msgid ""
"Ha caducado: ya no sale en la pantalla (vida de los mensajes: %(min)s "
"min). No está retirado por moderación."
msgstr ""
"It has expired: it no longer shows on the screen (message lifetime: "
"%(min)s min). It has not been removed by moderation."

